  title: A SCANDALOUS SECRET
  description: "My Pontiff, rumors have reached us from our little birds in the Pink
    Quarter. I shall cut straight to the chase, as the mere act of writing this revolts
    me: it appears an aristocrat from Iris harbors a peculiar erotic fondness for...
    barn animals. Disturbing, I know, but we might yet turn this deviant\u2019s sins
    to our advantage."
